  "description": "Camp Registration records session placement, cabin group, transportation, activity support, packing readiness, and guardian orientation. Camp Registration evidence stays linked.",
  "use_case": "Use this camp registration evidence-based review when staff must document session placement and cabin group. Reconcile transportation, activity support, packing readiness, and guardian orientation before the camp registration handoff. Use the placement confirmation, unit roster, bus list, optional-activity choices, support-routing receipt, orientation delivery, and guardian confirmation. This registration establishes seasonal program placement, cabin community, counselor coverage, waterfront or excursion choices, packing readiness, and multi-day guardian release. Ask the assigned camp registration reviewer to confirm session placement against the organization's policy.",
